    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0172" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United States to the President of
                        Chile.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On behalf of the sufferers at Galveston, and in the name of the sorrowing people
                    of this country, I gratefully acknowledge your excellency’s message of
                    condolence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William McKinley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
